    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A well maintained 2 bedroom bungalow occupying a large elevated private site. Enjoying expansive rural views the bungalow is located midway between Raphoe and Convoy. Accommodation comprises Sitting Room, Kitchen/Living Room with solid fuel range, Utility, 2 Bedrooms and Bathroom. Externally the building has a large lean-to car port plus a small general purpose shed plus a large hard-core surfaced parking area. Featuring dual fuel central heating and built before the era of defective concrete blocks this property is an ideal starter home or perfect for anyone seeking a smaller bungalow which has lots of space to extend if desired."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Sitting Room, Kitchen/Living Room, Utility, 2 Bedrooms and Bathroom.<br><br>\nSitting Room - 4.3m x 3.0m <br>Cast iron fireplace with open fire,\nCarpeted,\nFront facing windows.<br><br><br>\nKitchen/Living Room - 4.5m x 3.6m <br>Stanley solid fuel range,\nHigh & low level kitchen units - tiled between,\nElectric oven, electric hob & fridge-freezer,\nContains airing cupboard with hot water cylinder,\nFloor tiled,\nFront facing window.<br><br><br>\nUtility - 2.2m x 1.5m <br>Plumbed for washing machine & tumble dryer - included\nWork top & 2 High level cupboards,\nTiled floor,\nGable Window & back door.\n<br><br><br>\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m x 2.8m <br>Gable window,\nLaminated timber floor.<br><br><br>\nBedroom 2 - 3.0m x 2.3m <br>Window overlooking rear yard,\nLaminated timber floor.<br><br><br>\nBathroom - 2.6m 1.5m <br>White WHB, WC & Bath, \nTiled floor,\nAll walls finished with PVC wall panels,\nWindow.<br><br><br>\nLean to Car-port - 8.0m x 4.7m <br>Concrete floor,\nPerspex roof and side sheeting,\n1.2m height at highest point <br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Peaceful rural setting.\nDual fuel central heating.\nSpacious hard-core surfaced parking area."
      },
